    {
      "id": "8d2430a8ea095e31",
      "text": "&lt;p&gt;Several measures were previously introduced or supported by Coalition, prompting claim Liberals and Nationals would ‘let climate change rip’&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/sep/23/anthony-albanese-un-assembly-ai-social-media-labor-coalition-abc-four-corners-ntwnfb\"&gt;Follow our Australia news live blog for latest updates&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get our &lt;a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\"&gt;breaking news email&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\"&gt;free app&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\"&gt;daily news podcast&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Angus Taylor has vowed to repeal a raft of emissions reduction and renewable energy policies, including several measures supported by or introduced under past Coalition governments, within a month of being elected prime minister, prompting accusations he would “let climate change rip”.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On Wednesday, Taylor’s energy spokesperson, Dan Tehan, announced a new bill would be introduced to parliament within 30 days after a Coalition win at the next federal election to ensure affordable, reliable and secure energy to Australians.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Scrap &lt;a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2026/feb/18/carmakers-face-possible-heavy-fines-in-australia-for-failing-to-meet-climate-targets\"&gt;vehicle emissions standards&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remove the legislated net zero by 2050 target.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Revoke four of six offshore wind energy zones due for completion by the late 2030s: the Hunter, Illawarra, Southern Ocean and Bunbury regions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Introduce a renewable energy code of conduct for developers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Require energy funding provided to states and territories prioritises energy affordability and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Change the Australian Energy Regulator’s main focus to affordability and reliability.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/sep/23/angus-taylor-pledges-to-repeal-swathe-of-climate-policies-saying-australia-has-done-its-bit\"&gt;Continue reading...&lt;/a&gt;",
      "title": "Angus Taylor pledges to repeal swathe of climate policies, saying ‘Australia has done its bit’",
      "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/sep/23/angus-taylor-pledges-to-repeal-swathe-of-climate-policies-saying-australia-has-done-its-bit",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-23T06:45:12.000Z",
      "extra": {
        "source": "The Guardian — World [T3]",
        "category": "news"
      }
    },
