    {
      "id": "f50e618f9e3a9a36",
      "text": "&lt;p&gt;Due to take off in 2028, it is set to be the national carrier’s second ultra long-haul route after Sydney to London&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/sep/23/anthony-albanese-un-assembly-ai-social-media-labor-coalition-abc-four-corners-ntwnfb\"&gt;Follow our Australia news live blog for latest updates&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get our &lt;a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\"&gt;breaking news email&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\"&gt;free app&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\"&gt;daily news podcast&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Qantas says travellers will be able to fly between Sydney and New York in just 18 hours from mid-2028 when the airline launches its second ultra long-haul route, cutting at least three hours from the travel time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The route will be the second in Qantas’ Project Sunrise expansion plans, with new &lt;a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/jun/18/qantas-delays-non-stop-flights-from-sydney-to-london-again\"&gt;Sydney to London direct flights&lt;/a&gt; planned for October 2027, after some delays.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/sep/23/qantas-direct-flights-from-sydney-to-new-york\"&gt;Continue reading...&lt;/a&gt;",
      "title": "Qantas announces 18-hour direct flights from Sydney to New York with onboard ‘wellbeing zones’",
      "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/sep/23/qantas-direct-flights-from-sydney-to-new-york",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-23T05:17:07.000Z",
      "extra": {
        "source": "The Guardian — World [T3]",
        "category": "news"
      }
    },
